WEBVTT

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.534
will have one,

00:12:30.534 --> 00:12:32.935
and the idea of connecting everyone

00:12:32.935 --> 00:12:36.185
to both knowledge and each other will endure.

00:12:36.185 --> 00:12:37.493
So what's next?

00:12:37.493 --> 00:12:40.899
What imminent advance will be
the equivalent of the Pantheon?

00:12:40.899 --> 00:12:42.334
Thinking about this,

00:12:42.334 --> 00:12:44.881
I rejected many very plausible

00:12:44.881 --> 00:12:46.777
and dramatic breakthroughs to come,

00:12:46.777 --> 00:12:48.794
such as curing cancer.

00:12:48.794 --> 00:12:52.132
Why? Because Pantheons are anchored

00:12:52.132 --> 00:12:55.067
in designed physical objects,

00:12:55.067 --> 00:12:57.389
ones that inspire by simply seeing

00:12:57.389 --> 00:12:58.809
and experiencing them,

00:12:58.809 --> 00:13:01.691
and will continue to do so indefinitely.